  <History Date="23-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (everything looks very strange.  not convinced)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="24-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="2" />
  <History Date="25-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed CMY start ranges to 128 in line with charts (looks wrong)" Version="3" />
  <History Date="20-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Flash Butrym Moving Head 17R CMY (F7100109) (identical.  same strange ranges for CMY.  note specs include 24 channel mode but charts only show 32.  assumed the same and left original for now)" Version="4" />
  <History Date="21-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's (32 channel mode only - 24 channel mode is not detailed in documentation)." Version="5" />
  <History Date="21-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Moving Head 17R CMY (F7100532) to Moving Head 17R CMY (F7100562) (F7100532 is the part number for a set of two.  F7100562 is the actual part number)" Version="5" />
